{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手林暐竣REGENT全新單曲《離苦》，將佛學「八苦」與「五蘊」哲理，融入現代情感深遠意境。</p><p>為將歌曲中「解開執念、回歸當下」信息更具體呈現，MV以宏大時空交錯敘事，為聽眾帶來視覺與心靈的雙重衝擊。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T13:01:23.591898+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T12:13:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T15:18:18.468271+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:58:25.020297+00:00","content_hash":"0f1dc25d8b5b0b1f4301aeb66b5c5d56770424d5fa13b2fe90eb6478980fd183","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}